		(property "Description" "Patented noise/EMI reduction circuitry implemented; MicroPak Pb-Free leadless package; Outputs are overvoltage tolerant in 3-STATE mode; Power down high impedance inputs/outputs; Broad VCC Operating Range: 1.65V to 5.5V; High Output Drive; +/-24 mA at 3V VCC; Matches the performance of LCX when operated at 3.3V VCC; Space saving US8 surface mount package; Overvoltage tolerant inputs facilitate 5V to 3V translation; Ultra High Speed; tPD 2.6 ns Typ into 50 pF at 5V VCC"
